    "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:09:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-25T09:09:32Z",
    "body": "I think these are just mistakes and it should say node instead.\n\nWe should also make \"insertion location\" a tuple of parent (a DocumentFragment or Element) and before (null or a `table` element seems like the most minimal data structure that works).\n\nHistorical context:\n\nThis refactoring happened in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/6a4abafb3e8cb18b61e490d39b158cbf78a4f550 and https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/3a88aa51a2e5b5edd384844e99ea225722058a47 to make it easier to introduce the `template` element in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/685a5e0b27e963f6b0a62a21cb95078171076e3b and as we have since learned none of this was very carefully reviewed as we keep discovering issues with that element.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
